  <aggregations>
    <operations override="true">
      <composition>
        <workflow:AgenticOperation name="Copy A03 data into A04" status="Succeeded" captureOutput="true">
          <startedAt>2026-09-17T21:57:40</startedAt>
          <baseCommit>37fac8ef7e9b72030ad92a4c696e489b7e71f10f</baseCommit>
          <output>Task complete. `A04_01_CopyData` has been executed:

1. **Wipe** — already satisfied (A04 data was empty at the start of this operation, per the `0827a9d` commit).
2. **Copy** — all 45 files from `a03_authoring/data` (1 DocSet, 9 PageGroups, 35 DocPages) copied into `a04_rendering/data`, preserving structure.
3. **Remap** — package/xmlns URIs, aliases (`a03data`→`a04data`, `a03pgroup`→`a04pgroup`), `BmlDocSet_A03`→`BmlDocSet_A04` (with file rename), and sector-identity prose (`A03`→`A04`) applied throughout. The DocSet's pipeline description was adapted to name A04's actual sibling task (`filled by A04_01_CopyData. Page content is then rendered by A04_02_RenderPages.`, since A04's second task renders rather than authors) — same for the ~30 per-page &quot;authored in a03&quot; → &quot;rendered in a04&quot; mentions.
4. **Confirm** — diffed against source; file set, `pages`/`pageGroups`/`homePage`/`rootPageGroup`, and `parentGroup`/`see`-links all resolve only to A04 counterparts. No leftover A03 tokens remain.
5. **Export** — `Library.bml` already carried the correct A04 catalog entries from an earlier run, so nothing needed there.

`npx blockml validate --all` shows no new errors from this change (the 10 pre-existing errors are unrelated: stale historical `_meta/transform` snapshots and `com/acme/example` sample files). Changes are left uncommitted for the transform harness to commit as part of its own operation bookkeeping.</output>
          <completedAt>2026-09-17T22:03:22</completedAt>
          <task>
            <a04_task:A04_01_CopyData />
          </task>
          <changedFiles>
            <type:FilePathEntity value="packages/bmldocs/blocks/org/blockml/bml/bmldocs/a04_rendering/data/" />
          </changedFiles>
        </workflow:AgenticOperation>
        <workflow:AgenticOperation name="Render A04 pages" status="Succeeded" captureOutput="true">
          <startedAt>2026-09-17T22:03:23</startedAt>
          <baseCommit>c35e6e3b09a558d694b2f66131f90ff18b7e2b26</baseCommit>
          <output>`A04_02_RenderPages` is complete. Summary:

**Task executed**: rendered all 35 A04 pages in place, per `A04_02_RenderPages`'s instructions, `RenderingRules` (14 composed sub-rules inspected and applied), and the two success criteria.

- Every `Paragraph` now holds real prose (`page:Text`) synthesizing its `message`/`supportingPoints` rather than copying them verbatim; every `CodeBlock` holds a complete, valid BML listing built from a consistent example vocabulary (`acme:Widget`, `Basket`, `Point`, `Direction`, `Label`) grounded in the task's `authorativeSources` (`org.blockml.bml.core.*`, `org.blockml.bml.documentation.*`, etc.).
- Specification altitude stripped from every page per the task's rules: `authoritativeSources`, `scopes`, `readerOutcomes`, `learningObjectives`, `exclusions`, `supportingPoints`, `audiences`, and `purpose` are gone; `title`, `pageType`, `detailLevel`, `rules`, and the content tree are kept, with no elements added/removed/reordered.
- Verified with `grep`: no leftover spec-only tags, no `purpose=` attributes, no stray A03 references anywhere in `a04_rendering/data`.
- Both success criteria hold: every `CodeBlock` has a non-empty complete listing (`CodeBlockHasListing`), and every `CodeBlock` is immediately followed by its explanation `Paragraph` (`CodeBlockFollowedByExplanation`).
- `npx blockml validate --all` shows the same 10 pre-existing errors as before I started (stale `com/acme/example` sample files and historical `_meta/transform` snapshots) — nothing new.

Only the 35 A04 page files changed; nothing else was touched, and nothing was committed, consistent with how the earlier operations in this same transform (`T00016_BuildA04`) left their own bookkeeping to the surrounding harness.
</output>
          <completedAt>2026-09-17T22:28:01</completedAt>
          <task>
            <a04_task:A04_02_RenderPages />
          </task>
